[31m-- **No Token Bloat**: Exclude lockfiles, minified bundles, and binary assets from diff representations.[m
[31m-- **Google Labs Exploration Budget Protocol**: Execute complex multi-step tasks across 3 discrete phases: (1) Discovery & Symbol Tracing (silent inspection, write NO code), (2) Oracle & Test Formulation, and (3) Surgical Implementation & Verification.[m
